# The book "Kith Venom" lies on the far side of a table in Tenebrae (map
# 39), 103 from the Avatar: he could take it from there, but a click to
# read it sent him round the table first (and on the way upstairs). Use
# reaches as far as taking does (128, as in the original): he reads it
# where he stands
args: --map 39 --pos 15762,7942,48
do: t3;useat:29175;t30;where:1
expect: useat: used at once
expect: reader open (book)
expect: where 1: 15762,7942,48
